  "content": "<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_header.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"783\"></span></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">Better Create Aeronautics 是一个以科技为核心的模组包，专为喜欢建造、自动化和试验 Create 及 Create Aeronautics 各种玩法的玩家打造。</span></p>\n</div><div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_description.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"211\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">本模组包的目标并非仅仅增加机器，而是让世界变得更生动、更值得探索。除了多个 Create 附加模组，它还包含全新的生物群系、动物、建筑、生物以及大量提升游戏体验的优化内容，让每次游玩都更加完整。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">你将能够建造从小型生产线到巨型工厂的一切，构建复杂的自动化系统，以及制作功能完整的飞行器，以全新的方式环游世界。同时，游戏进度保持平衡，单人模式和多人模式都能提供流畅的体验。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\"></span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1692/125/create-aeronautics-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1692/132/captura-de-pantalla-2026-05-21-191407.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">想和朋友一起玩吗？</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Better_Create_Aeronautics/MP_BetterCreateAeronautics_promo.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"267\"></span></a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">如果你想支持我和我的内容，我推荐试试 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a>。使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fwarrior%253fr%253dcreateaeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的代码可享首月 25% 折扣</strong></span></a>，适用于新客户购买游戏服务器。他们提供全天候支持和闪电般的响应速度，确保你得到可靠服务，并为你所有游戏需求提供卓越协助。</span></p>",
